{"seq":2,"slug":"crawling-indexing-ranking","title":"抓取、索引与排名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/seo/foundations/crawling-indexing-ranking","wordCount":1444,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"抓取-索引与排名\">抓取、索引与排名</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>抓取、索引与排名是搜索引擎处理网页的三个连续阶段，也是 SEO 工作的三个着力点。<strong>抓取决定&quot;能不能被看到&quot;，索引决定&quot;能不能被收录&quot;，排名决定&quot;能不能被排前面&quot;</strong>——三者的门槛依次递进，前一阶段失败则后一阶段无从优化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n<th>典型 SEO 动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抓取</td>\n<td>爬虫能否发现并访问页面</td>\n<td>抓取预算、服务器健康、robots.txt</td>\n<td>提交 Sitemap、减少重定向链、清理死链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引</td>\n<td>页面是否达到收录质量标准</td>\n<td>内容质量、重复内容、canonical</td>\n<td>充实内容、设置 canonical、修正 noindex</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排名</td>\n<td>页面能否在竞争中胜出</td>\n<td>相关性、权威性、用户体验</td>\n<td>提升内容与链接质量、优化 E-E-A-T</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>此外要记住一个前提：<strong>抓取预算有限</strong>（爬虫在单位时间内愿意为站点分配的抓取资源），因此减少低价值页面同样是 SEO 的一部分。排名阶段的评估也已从单纯的关键词匹配，演进为语义理解（BERT/MUM）与质量框架（E-E-A-T）的结合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"爬虫抓取的完整生命周期\">爬虫抓取的完整生命周期</h2><p>搜索引擎的抓取过程远比&quot;访问一个 URL&quot;复杂得多。一个高效的爬取系统需要在有限的资源下最大化网页覆盖率，同时尊重网站服务器的承受能力。理解抓取的每一个环节，可以帮助我们有针对性地优化网站的可抓取性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[URL 发现] --&gt; B[URL 优先级排序]&#10;    B --&gt; C[抓取调度]&#10;    C --&gt; D[DNS 解析]&#10;    D --&gt; E[HTTP 请求]&#10;    E --&gt; F{响应状态码}&#10;    F --&gt;|200 OK| G[内容下载]&#10;    F --&gt;|301/302| H[跟随重定向]&#10;    F --&gt;|404| I[标记为失效]&#10;    F --&gt;|503| J[稍后重试]&#10;    H --&gt; E&#10;    G --&gt; K[内容去重]&#10;    K --&gt; L[送入索引管线]\">graph TD\n    A[URL 发现] --&gt; B[URL 优先级排序]\n    B --&gt; C[抓取调度]\n    C --&gt; D[DNS 解析]\n    D --&gt; E[HTTP 请求]\n    E --&gt; F{响应状态码}\n    F --&gt;|200 OK| G[内容下载]\n    F --&gt;|301/302| H[跟随重定向]\n    F --&gt;|404| I[标记为失效]\n    F --&gt;|503| J[稍后重试]\n    H --&gt; E\n    G --&gt; K[内容去重]\n    K --&gt; L[送入索引管线]</pre><h3 id=\"url-发现机制\">URL 发现机制</h3><p>搜索引擎通过多种途径发现新的 URL：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发现途径</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>站内链接跟踪</td>\n<td>从已知页面中提取新链接</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XML Sitemap</td>\n<td>网站主动提交的 URL 列表</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Search Console 提交</td>\n<td>手动提交新 URL 或更新的 URL</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部链接</td>\n<td>其他网站指向你的链接</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器数据（Chrome UX）</td>\n<td>用户访问行为中的新 URL</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"抓取预算-crawl-budget\">抓取预算（Crawl Budget）</h3><p>抓取预算是一个核心概念，指搜索引擎在特定时间段内愿意为你的网站分配的抓取资源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CrawlBudgetFactors {&#10;  crawlRateLimit: number;&#10;  crawlDemand: number;&#10;  serverHealth: &#39;healthy&#39; | &#39;degraded&#39; | &#39;overloaded&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CrawlOptimization {&#10;  removeDeadUrls: boolean;&#10;  blockLowValuePages: boolean;&#10;  optimizeServerResponse: boolean;&#10;  reduceRedirectChains: boolean;&#10;  updateSitemap: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const budgetStrategy: CrawlOptimization = {&#10;  removeDeadUrls: true,&#10;  blockLowValuePages: true,&#10;  optimizeServerResponse: true,&#10;  reduceRedirectChains: true,&#10;  updateSitemap: true,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrawlBudgetFactors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  crawlRateLimit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  crawlDemand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  serverHealth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'healthy'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'degraded'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'overloaded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrawlOptimization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  removeDeadUrls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  blockLowValuePages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  optimizeServerResponse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reduceRedirectChains</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  updateSitemap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> budgetStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrawlOptimization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  removeDeadUrls: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  blockLowValuePages: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  optimizeServerResponse: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reduceRedirectChains: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updateSitemap: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>影响抓取预算的因素：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 抓取速率限制&#10;        A[服务器响应速度] --&gt; D[抓取预算]&#10;        B[服务器健康状态] --&gt; D&#10;        C[robots.txt 限制] --&gt; D&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 抓取需求&#10;        E[页面更新频率] --&gt; D&#10;        F[页面重要性] --&gt; D&#10;        G[站点规模] --&gt; D&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 抓取速率限制\n        A[服务器响应速度] --&gt; D[抓取预算]\n        B[服务器健康状态] --&gt; D\n        C[robots.txt 限制] --&gt; D\n    end\n    subgraph 抓取需求\n        E[页面更新频率] --&gt; D\n        F[页面重要性] --&gt; D\n        G[站点规模] --&gt; D\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"索引的深层机制\">索引的深层机制</h2><h3 id=\"内容解析与理解\">内容解析与理解</h3><p>搜索引擎在索引页面时不是简单地存储 HTML 文本，而是经过一系列复杂的处理步骤来理解页面内容。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始 HTML] --&gt; B[DOM 解析]&#10;    B --&gt; C[内容区域识别]&#10;    C --&gt; D[主要内容提取]&#10;    C --&gt; E[导航/侧栏/页脚识别]&#10;    D --&gt; F[自然语言处理]&#10;    F --&gt; G[实体识别]&#10;    F --&gt; H[主题分类]&#10;    F --&gt; I[语义关系抽取]&#10;    G --&gt; J[(知识图谱)]&#10;    H --&gt; K[(主题索引)]&#10;    I --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[原始 HTML] --&gt; B[DOM 解析]\n    B --&gt; C[内容区域识别]\n    C --&gt; D[主要内容提取]\n    C --&gt; E[导航/侧栏/页脚识别]\n    D --&gt; F[自然语言处理]\n    F --&gt; G[实体识别]\n    F --&gt; H[主题分类]\n    F --&gt; I[语义关系抽取]\n    G --&gt; J[(知识图谱)]\n    H --&gt; K[(主题索引)]\n    I --&gt; K</pre><h3 id=\"索引覆盖率问题\">索引覆盖率问题</h3><p>并非所有被抓取的页面都会被编入索引。搜索引擎会根据多种因素决定是否索引一个页面。</p>\n<p>常见的索引排除原因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Discovered – currently not indexed</td>\n<td>页面已发现但未被抓取</td>\n<td>提高页面质量和内链权重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crawled – currently not indexed</td>\n<td>页面已抓取但质量不达标</td>\n<td>充实内容，增加独特价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Duplicate without user-selected canonical</td>\n<td>被判定为重复内容</td>\n<td>设置正确的 canonical 标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blocked by robots.txt</td>\n<td>robots.txt 阻止了抓取</td>\n<td>检查并修正 robots.txt 规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Noindex tag</td>\n<td>页面设置了 noindex</td>\n<td>移除 noindex 指令</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;head&gt;&#10;  &lt;meta name=&quot;robots&quot; content=&quot;index, follow&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;link rel=&quot;canonical&quot; href=&quot;https://example.com/canonical-page&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;meta property=&quot;og:title&quot; content=&quot;页面标题&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;meta property=&quot;og:description&quot; content=&quot;页面描述&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;meta property=&quot;og:url&quot; content=&quot;https://example.com/canonical-page&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/head&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">head</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"robots\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"index, follow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">link</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"canonical\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://example.com/canonical-page\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"og:title\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"页面标题\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"og:description\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"页面描述\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"og:url\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://example.com/canonical-page\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">head</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"移动优先索引-mobile-first-indexing\">移动优先索引（Mobile-First Indexing）</h3><p>自 2021 年起，Google 完全采用移动优先索引，意味着 Google 主要使用页面的移动版本来进行索引和排名。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;head&gt;&#10;  &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/head&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">head</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"viewport\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">head</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>移动版和桌面版应包含相同的主要内容</li>\n<li>移动版必须包含完整的结构化数据</li>\n<li>移动版的 Meta 标签（title, description）应与桌面版一致</li>\n<li>图片必须在移动端可访问并有合适的 alt 属性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"排名算法深度解析\">排名算法深度解析</h2><h3 id=\"pagerank-与链接图\">PageRank 与链接图</h3><p>PageRank 是 Google 最早也是最著名的排名算法之一，它通过分析网页之间的链接关系来评估页面的权威性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[页面 A&lt;br&gt;PR: 0.85] --&gt;|链接| B[页面 B&lt;br&gt;PR: 1.20]&#10;    A --&gt;|链接| C[页面 C&lt;br&gt;PR: 0.65]&#10;    B --&gt;|链接| C&#10;    D[页面 D&lt;br&gt;PR: 2.10] --&gt;|链接| B&#10;    E[页面 E&lt;br&gt;PR: 0.90] --&gt;|链接| A&#10;    E --&gt;|链接| C&#10;    C --&gt;|链接| A\">graph TD\n    A[页面 A&lt;br&gt;PR: 0.85] --&gt;|链接| B[页面 B&lt;br&gt;PR: 1.20]\n    A --&gt;|链接| C[页面 C&lt;br&gt;PR: 0.65]\n    B --&gt;|链接| C\n    D[页面 D&lt;br&gt;PR: 2.10] --&gt;|链接| B\n    E[页面 E&lt;br&gt;PR: 0.90] --&gt;|链接| A\n    E --&gt;|链接| C\n    C --&gt;|链接| A</pre><p>PageRank 的核心思想：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>被更多高质量页面链接的页面，权威性更高</li>\n<li>链接的权重会被分散——一个页面有 N 个出站链接，每个链接传递的权重约为 PR/N</li>\n<li>存在衰减因子（damping factor，通常为 0.85）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"语义搜索与用户意图\">语义搜索与用户意图</h3><p>现代搜索引擎早已超越了简单的关键词匹配。Google 的 BERT 和 MUM 等模型可以深度理解查询的语义和上下文。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 用户意图分类&#10;        A[导航型&lt;br&gt;找特定网站] --&gt; D[搜索引擎理解意图]&#10;        B[信息型&lt;br&gt;寻找知识] --&gt; D&#10;        C[交易型&lt;br&gt;购买/下载] --&gt; D&#10;    end&#10;    D --&gt; E[匹配最佳内容类型]\">graph LR\n    subgraph 用户意图分类\n        A[导航型&lt;br&gt;找特定网站] --&gt; D[搜索引擎理解意图]\n        B[信息型&lt;br&gt;寻找知识] --&gt; D\n        C[交易型&lt;br&gt;购买/下载] --&gt; D\n    end\n    D --&gt; E[匹配最佳内容类型]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type SearchIntent = &#39;navigational&#39; | &#39;informational&#39; | &#39;transactional&#39; | &#39;commercial&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface QueryAnalysis {&#10;  query: string;&#10;  intent: SearchIntent;&#10;  entities: string[];&#10;  relatedTopics: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const examples: QueryAnalysis[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    query: &#39;React 官网&#39;,&#10;    intent: &#39;navigational&#39;,&#10;    entities: [&#39;React&#39;],&#10;    relatedTopics: [&#39;JavaScript 框架&#39;, &#39;前端开发&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    query: &#39;React useEffect 怎么用&#39;,&#10;    intent: &#39;informational&#39;,&#10;    entities: [&#39;React&#39;, &#39;useEffect&#39;],&#10;    relatedTopics: [&#39;React Hooks&#39;, &#39;副作用&#39;, &#39;生命周期&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    query: &#39;React 培训课程购买&#39;,&#10;    intent: &#39;transactional&#39;,&#10;    entities: [&#39;React&#39;, &#39;培训课程&#39;],&#10;    relatedTopics: [&#39;在线教育&#39;, &#39;前端学习&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SearchIntent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'navigational'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'informational'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'transactional'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'commercial'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  intent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SearchIntent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  relatedTopics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> examples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    query: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'React 官网'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    intent: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'navigational'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entities: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'React'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    relatedTopics: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'JavaScript 框架'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'前端开发'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    query: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'React useEffect 怎么用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    intent: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'informational'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entities: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'React'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'useEffect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    relatedTopics: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'React Hooks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'副作用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'生命周期'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    query: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'React 培训课程购买'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    intent: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'transactional'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entities: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'React'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'培训课程'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    relatedTopics: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'在线教育'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'前端学习'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"e-e-a-t-质量评估框架\">E-E-A-T 质量评估框架</h3><p>Google 使用 E-E-A-T（Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, Trustworthiness）框架来评估内容质量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>SEO 建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Experience（经验）</td>\n<td>创作者的第一手经验</td>\n<td>分享实际案例和个人见解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expertise（专业性）</td>\n<td>领域内的专业知识</td>\n<td>展示技术深度，引用权威来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Authoritativeness（权威性）</td>\n<td>在领域内的认可度</td>\n<td>获取高质量外链，建立个人品牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trustworthiness（可信度）</td>\n<td>内容的准确性和可靠性</td>\n<td>确保事实准确，提供来源引用，使用 HTTPS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"http-状态码与-seo\">HTTP 状态码与 SEO</h2><p>搜索引擎通过 HTTP 状态码来理解页面的状态，正确使用状态码对 SEO 至关重要。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const seoStatusCodeGuide: Record&lt;number, { meaning: string; seoImpact: string }&gt; = {&#10;  200: {&#10;    meaning: &#39;成功&#39;,&#10;    seoImpact: &#39;正常索引页面&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  301: {&#10;    meaning: &#39;永久重定向&#39;,&#10;    seoImpact: &#39;将链接权重传递给目标 URL，旧 URL 逐渐从索引中移除&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  302: {&#10;    meaning: &#39;临时重定向&#39;,&#10;    seoImpact: &#39;链接权重保留在原 URL，搜索引擎可能继续索引原 URL&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  404: {&#10;    meaning: &#39;页面不存在&#39;,&#10;    seoImpact: &#39;页面将从索引中移除，过多 404 可能影响抓取效率&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  410: {&#10;    meaning: &#39;已永久删除&#39;,&#10;    seoImpact: &#39;比 404 更明确地告诉搜索引擎该页面已不存在&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  503: {&#10;    meaning: &#39;服务暂时不可用&#39;,&#10;    seoImpact: &#39;搜索引擎会稍后重试，不会立即从索引中移除&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> seoStatusCodeGuide</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">meaning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">seoImpact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meaning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'成功'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seoImpact: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'正常索引页面'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  301</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meaning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'永久重定向'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seoImpact: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'将链接权重传递给目标 URL，旧 URL 逐渐从索引中移除'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  302</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meaning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'临时重定向'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seoImpact: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'链接权重保留在原 URL，搜索引擎可能继续索引原 URL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  404</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meaning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'页面不存在'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seoImpact: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'页面将从索引中移除，过多 404 可能影响抓取效率'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  410</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meaning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'已永久删除'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seoImpact: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'比 404 更明确地告诉搜索引擎该页面已不存在'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  503</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meaning: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'服务暂时不可用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seoImpact: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'搜索引擎会稍后重试，不会立即从索引中移除'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>URL 发现依赖站内链接、Sitemap、外链和手动提交等多种途径，确保重要页面可被发现是 SEO 的基本功。</li>\n<li>抓取预算有限，应减少低价值页面、优化服务器响应、消除重定向链来提高抓取效率。</li>\n<li>索引不是自动的——页面需要达到质量标准才会被收录，重复内容和低质量内容会被排除。</li>\n<li>移动优先索引要求移动版页面内容完整，响应式设计是最佳实践。</li>\n<li>排名系统综合考虑内容相关性、链接权威性、用户体验和 E-E-A-T 质量信号。</li>\n<li>正确使用 HTTP 状态码和重定向策略直接影响搜索引擎对页面状态的理解。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抓取、索引与排名","id":"抓取-索引与排名"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"爬虫抓取的完整生命周期","id":"爬虫抓取的完整生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"URL 发现机制","id":"url-发现机制"},{"level":3,"text":"抓取预算（Crawl Budget）","id":"抓取预算-crawl-budget"},{"level":2,"text":"索引的深层机制","id":"索引的深层机制"},{"level":3,"text":"内容解析与理解","id":"内容解析与理解"},{"level":3,"text":"索引覆盖率问题","id":"索引覆盖率问题"},{"level":3,"text":"移动优先索引（Mobile-First Indexing）","id":"移动优先索引-mobile-first-indexing"},{"level":2,"text":"排名算法深度解析","id":"排名算法深度解析"},{"level":3,"text":"PageRank 与链接图","id":"pagerank-与链接图"},{"level":3,"text":"语义搜索与用户意图","id":"语义搜索与用户意图"},{"level":3,"text":"E-E-A-T 质量评估框架","id":"e-e-a-t-质量评估框架"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP 状态码与 SEO","id":"http-状态码与-seo"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"搜索引擎工作原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/seo/foundations/how-search-engines-work"},"next":{"title":"前端开发者的 SEO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/seo/foundations/seo-for-frontend-developers"}}